# flate --krmignore for the whole-tree render (-p kubernetes) in
# .github/workflows/kubernetes.yaml. Patterns are relative to kubernetes/.
#
# A cluster entrypoint that has its own render step goes here: every cluster
# defines flux-system/cluster-settings and cluster-secrets, and the whole-tree
# render keeps one object per name, so a second reachable cluster would
# substitute its settings into homelab-wsl's apps.
clusters/wsl-02/
